#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:1 572f388dd7384831a3a4d76e54abd9c2
msgid "评测协议与指标"
msgstr "Evaluation Protocol and Metrics"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:3 3248d1da097b4d05867395f91c213053
msgid ""
"为了消除单次随机划分的数据集偏差，为学术论文与基准评测提供统计显著的评估结果，知识追踪研究普遍执行 5 "
"折交叉验证并报告各折平均指标。各模型在该协议下的具体评测成绩可查阅[基准排行榜](leaderboard.md)。"
msgstr ""
"To eliminate single-split dataset bias and provide statistically sound "
"results for academic research and benchmarks, knowledge tracing studies "
"widely adopt 5-fold cross-validation and report cross-fold averages. "
"Detailed benchmark scores under this protocol can be inspected in the "
"[Benchmark Leaderboard](leaderboard.md)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:5 1493197b8b5b4f77b7f95c25a8bd92f4
msgid "标准 5 折交叉验证"
msgstr "Standard 5-Fold Cross-Validation"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:7 415af951592f4ff3a90fbc7a27ecfbab
msgid "知识追踪中的学生分层切分协议"
msgstr "Student-Level Stratified Splitting in Knowledge Tracing"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:9 14c74a8081354827bbd325d5acf982ca
msgid "在知识追踪任务中，若直接对全部答题记录进行随机打乱切分，会导致严重的数据泄露：同一学生不同时段的答题记录被同时割裂在训练集与测试集中，使评估虚高。"
msgstr ""
"In knowledge tracing tasks, randomly shuffling and splitting all "
"interaction logs causes severe data leakage: interactions from the same "
"student across different timestamps become partitioned between train and "
"test sets, inflating metrics artificially."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:11 a49494136ce041c48e20a904ce8fb610
msgid ""
"UniKT 严格遵守教育数据挖掘的标准评估协议。系统按学生总答题量与正答率进行分层，将所有学生均匀划分为 5 折，划分标记保存在标准化 "
"Parquet 文件的 `fold` 列中。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT strictly adheres to standard educational data mining evaluation "
"protocols. The system stratifies students by total interactions and "
"accuracy, partitioning all students evenly into 5 folds recorded in the "
"`fold` column of standardized Parquet files."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:13 cfb44e50f112429fbee7b0f88af6f7f1
msgid "当指定 `--data.fold k` 运行时，各数据集切分对照如下："
msgstr "When running with `--data.fold k`, dataset splits are assigned as follows:"

