#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:23 870629d935964fb48d26b20518452bde
msgid "**Test 集**：第 `k` 折学生序列，完全不参与训练与早停决策。"
msgstr ""
"**Test Set**: Student sequences in fold `k`, strictly excluded from "
"training and early stopping decisions."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:24 0b23a10efc4b4bff91fe9dfbb769065e
msgid "**Val 集**：第 `(k - 1) % 5` 折学生序列，用于早停决策与最佳权重保存。"
msgstr ""
"**Val Set**: Student sequences in fold `(k - 1) % 5`, used for early "
"stopping and checkpoint selection."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:25 75d1044977f44ac4822684304298b732
msgid "**Train 集**：剩余 3 折学生序列，用于参数学习。"
msgstr ""
"**Train Set**: Remaining 3 folds of student sequences, used for model "
"parameter optimization."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:27 03d174badd14442f8d4763aac0136705
msgid "使用辅助脚本 `run_kfold.sh`"
msgstr "Using Helper Script `run_kfold.sh`"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:29 a0f6bbdc700c4b3d8905f4ec49973757
msgid "UniKT 在 `scripts/run_kfold.sh` 中提供了多折连续执行脚本，支持参数安全透传与多进程自动化串联。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT provides `scripts/run_kfold.sh` for consecutive multi-fold "
"execution, supporting transparent parameter forwarding and automated "
"sequential execution."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:31 b5138eec0de24e64a3daca8b819e49dd
msgid "A. 查看所有支持的模型列表"
msgstr "A. List All Supported Models"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:33 67b7a85a6c024cbd8b6509b79851613c
msgid "使用 `-l` 或 `--list` 选项列出当前代码库中所有已支持的模型："
msgstr "Use `-l` or `--list` to list all supported models in the current codebase:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:35 d941338c593f4e568606a0d1980b6ee1
msgid "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l\n"
msgstr "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:39 bbce7e43d3694f87aa9909778e68b258
msgid "B. 运行单模型的 5 折交叉验证"
msgstr "B. Run 5-Fold Cross-Validation for a Single Model"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:41 88509711759c48049e9b91bff3f2ce4e
msgid "向脚本传入模型名称、折索引列表及待透传的训练参数："
msgstr ""
"Pass the model name, fold index list, and training hyperparameters to the"
" script:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:43 9721dc1926f84d74be3430db74bd6b38
msgid ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09 "
"--model.epochs 150\n"
msgstr ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09 "
"--model.epochs 150\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:47 d7a050845b374f85a5d51cd6c1b48641
msgid ""
"支持空格分隔（`\"0 1 2 3 4\"`）或逗号分隔（`\"0,1,2,3,4\"`）。脚本将依次启动第 0 至第 4 "
"折的训练任务。若某折执行失败（Exit code $\\neq$ 0），脚本将立即中断并保留错误现场，避免无意义的算力消耗。"
msgstr ""
"Supports space-separated (`\"0 1 2 3 4\"`) or comma-separated "
"(`\"0,1,2,3,4\"`) strings. The script launches fold 0 through fold 4 "
"sequentially. If any fold fails (Exit code $\\neq$ 0), execution "
"terminates immediately to preserve error state and save compute "
"resources."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:49 53a6893404754b3195de5d90e89d835e
msgid "C. 运行特定子集折"
msgstr "C. Run a Subset of Folds"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:51 39ff56cc7dc84c928323087fff03d7b9
msgid "若某次训练在某几折中断，或只需在特定折验证："
msgstr ""
"If training was interrupted on specific folds, or if only a subset "
"requires validation:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:53 984dc3b9a7dd4d79a19e7e6434dd3270
msgid ""
"# 仅执行第 0 折和第 2 折\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 2\" -d assistments09 --model.epochs "
"100\n"
msgstr ""
"# Execute only fold 0 and fold 2\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 2\" -d assistments09 --model.epochs "
"100\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:58 9ff27047b1bb42e9881c379c018a490c
msgid "D. 原生命令行手动执行"
msgstr "D. Manual Invocation via Native CLI"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:60 2ffe0e99d00141f4a0e1a1f713311cf3
msgid "如果不使用 bash 脚本，也可以直接在终端通过原生循环调用 `train.py`："
msgstr ""
"Without the bash helper, you can directly run a native loop calling "
"`train.py` in the terminal:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:62 daf68cc2039a45f78a019a3092e2e9b7
msgid ""
"for fold in 0 1 2 3 4; do\n"
"  python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold $fold "
"--model.epochs 150\n"
"done\n"
msgstr ""
"for fold in 0 1 2 3 4; do\n"
"  python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold $fold "
"--model.epochs 150\n"
"done\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:68 943c0fbe59d8407b88a4a20c387ba874
msgid "5 折结果汇总与统计指标"
msgstr "5-Fold Aggregation and Summary Statistics"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:70 567cbefd0d3c4648b3eb99628ea0e774
msgid "完成 5 折训练后，`runs/normal/` 目录下将产生 5 个独立的实验子目录："
msgstr ""
"After completing 5-fold training, 5 distinct experiment subdirectories "
"are generated in `runs/normal/`:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:72 c50622c9db6a43ba9c840d982f14f04f
msgid ""
"runs/normal/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-100000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-102500_fold1_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-105000_fold2_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-111500_fold3_bs128/\n"
"└── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-114000_fold4_bs128/\n"
msgstr ""
"runs/normal/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-100000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-102500_fold1_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-105000_fold2_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-111500_fold3_bs128/\n"
"└── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-114000_fold4_bs128/\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:81 db463c467ea44b3bb7a3ae612b0bb48d
msgid "每个运行目录下的 `metrics_test.csv` 均记录了该折在测试集上的最终评测指标。可以使用如下代码快速计算 5 折均值与标准差："
msgstr ""
"Each run directory contains a `metrics_test.csv` file recording final "
"test set evaluation metrics. Use the snippet below to compute 5-fold mean"
" and standard deviation:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:83 daf4873d7b6c43d9a3590f4f63a92c99
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import glob\n"
"import pandas as pd\n"
"\n"
"# 匹配特定实验的所有折测试指标文件\n"
"metrics_files = sorted(\n"
"    "
"glob.glob(\"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_*_fold*_bs128/metrics_test.csv\")"
"\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"dfs = [pd.read_csv(f) for f in metrics_files]\n"
"summary = pd.concat(dfs, ignore_index=True)\n"
"\n"
"print(\"=== 5 折交叉验证测试集统计 ===\")\n"
"print(f\"有效折数: {len(summary)}\")\n"
"for metric in [\"auc\", \"acc\", \"rmse\"]:\n"
"    if metric in summary.columns:\n"
"        mean_val = summary[metric].mean()\n"
"        std_val = summary[metric].std()\n"
"        print(f\"{metric.upper():<6}: {mean_val:.4f} ± {std_val:.4f}\")\n"
msgstr ""
"import glob\n"
"import pandas as pd\n"
"\n"
"# Match test metrics files for all folds of a specific experiment\n"
"metrics_files = sorted(\n"
"    "
"glob.glob(\"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_*_fold*_bs128/metrics_test.csv\")"
"\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"dfs = [pd.read_csv(f) for f in metrics_files]\n"
"summary = pd.concat(dfs, ignore_index=True)\n"
"\n"
"print(\"=== 5-Fold Cross-Validation Test Set Statistics ===\")\n"
"print(f\"Valid Folds: {len(summary)}\")\n"
"for metric in [\"auc\", \"acc\", \"rmse\"]:\n"
"    if metric in summary.columns:\n"
"        mean_val = summary[metric].mean()\n"
"        std_val = summary[metric].std()\n"
"        print(f\"{metric.upper():<6}: {mean_val:.4f} ± {std_val:.4f}\")\n"

